{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1791335340, "covers_from": "2026-10-07T01:09:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-07T01:10:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1791335400, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-07T01:09:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 9028, "sprite_key": "squirrel_business", "district": "neihu", "topic": "交通", "content": "台北市的交通還是亂七八糟的，尤其是內湖跟中山區，如果您當選市長後，有沒有改善的計劃與推動的方針，謝謝", "display_name": "內湖代表 No.9,028", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-07T01:09:15+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 30608, "sprite_key": "squirrel_suburb", "district": "wenshan", "topic": "交通", "content": "我希望法令能強制規定在十字路口處的騎樓內不可以停機車/腳踏車. 不僅行人不便，開車視線也會被遮住.", "display_name": "文山代表 No.30,608", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-07T01:09:30+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 7702, "sprite_key": "deer_suburb", "district": "shilin", "topic": "觀光", "content": "市長我不是台北在地人，雖然這裡的公車很準時來的很快！但是公車司機開的太橫衝猛撞了，請讓司機有足夠時間", "display_name": "士林代表 No.7,702", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-07T01:09:45+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 22529, "sprite_key": "squirrel_suburb", "district": "wenshan", "topic": "交通", "content": "文山區興隆路萬芳醫院附近人行道窄，只要有人等公車，行人就得錯身，或走馬路。", "display_name": "文山代表 No.22,529", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 30608, "sprite_key": "squirrel_suburb", "display_name": "文山代表 No.30,608", "district": "wenshan", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 7702, "sprite_key": "deer_suburb", "display_name": "士林代表 No.7,702", "district": "shilin", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 3, "queue_number": 22529, "sprite_key": "squirrel_suburb", "display_name": "文山代表 No.22,529", "district": "wenshan", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 4, "queue_number": 7167, "sprite_key": "squirrel_business", "display_